	affiliations = {Enterpreneurship Study Program, Faculty Economic and Business Maritime, Universitas Maritim Raja Ali Haji, Indonesia},
	abstract = {This research explores the effect of online marketing through influencer collaborations on the sales and brand awareness of otak-otak products from Sungai Enam Otak-Otak Village. The primary objective is to understand how influencer endorsements influence consumer purchase intentions and ultimately drive sales growth. In an increasingly digital marketplace, social media influencers have become powerful marketing tools, especially for small local businesses looking to broaden their customer base. This study examines how influencer endorsements can shape consumer perceptions and boost brand visibility, leading to increased sales volume for otak-otak products. By analyzing data on consumer reactions, sales figures, and social media engagement, this research provides practical insights for local businesses in utilizing influencer marketing as a strategy to enhance brand awareness and market penetration. The findings are expected to highlight the significance of online marketing strategies in building strong brand connections with consumers. Ultimately, the results of this study can assist local businesses in making informed decisions when developing their marketing plans, especially in the competitive food industry. Understanding the role of social media influencers in driving consumer behavior is critical for future marketing success. © The Authors, published by EDP Sciences.},
