	affiliations = {Program Studi Teknik Informatika, Universitas Semarang, Semarang, Indonesia},
	abstract = {Internet and social media has attracted most users to earn extra income. Instagram originally used for visual storytelling, is now also used for a variety of things; such as to online shop. Instagram has convenience features like uploading photos and comments, that can make online seller can be successful in managing their business. But in the end, they realized that Instagram is not e-commerce that provides a standard feature for business. Dini Hari and Bale Bandeng is an online seller in Instagram, they plan to use e-commerce to assist business management, while using Instagram as media promotion. Their products are not suitable when sold in an online marketplace, such as BukaLapak or Tokopedia. Because they have a condition that the product must be directly up on the same day. The problem is, this private expedition determine shipping costs by regions, then these costs need to be integrated into the system. This research aims to solve the problem of delivery method, which is sometimes a problem for online sellers in Indonesia. pecifically applying e-commerce needs of the Dini Hari and Bale Bandeng, but only focused on the delivery of goods to find a solution that can connect between the seller's policies and shipping service policy. As a result, Dini Hari and Bale Bandeng can deliver products quickly, and buyers can order products through ecommerce applications and know the shipping costs according to the delivery zone predetermined.},
